490785522051_7060671143405339728_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XXkdY8aKBLgQ7kNvwE0-0k4&_nc_oc=Adk6RodlMaH2lusWNk7dUPHydqsB60JVc-7J9Z_Hb77g9SMm8r26fy2CLlcX9gBDB0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsS9b43jgQTh1NWJGmcsXrdT5yPiQReidykNA45RvMxMQ&oe=69A83732"}, {"file_name": "landscape_4.png", "id": "5564456170299960", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402515_5564456173633293_8166203934336264507_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M4Iat9TwsvEQ7kNvwHXptFh&_nc_oc=AdnUsc1UKVm6XY-8WSsuFYnk2_uKEkKzDL6ssCUKiwExuf5SiAbzX2zWijLSlB93qY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afufrl3yiTq6s75n6FKLxzcJfpuT3iShQVKRDEThwX0PQg&oe=69A817F6"}, {"file_name": "landscape_5.png", "id": "634797031492068", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_634797034825401_6944852042907467801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KnIbzRsZTsQ7kNvwH-CraQ&_nc_oc=AdmoApl8xqR-kYUxAn9x8k9AOE3adYFObEAAaAWdQl_1sn4pgPXT42m6Q6x3c_htz3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aft__hgdVYbF-hXyDjoBVFe3bcDC74DesC2FxhCoWxRkEA&oe=69A835EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Notre-Dame de Paris: Voyage dans le Pass\u00e9", "keywords": ["NotreDameDeParis", "NotreDame", "Paris"], "long_description": "(Re)-d\u00e9couvrez Notre-Dame de Paris telle qu\u2019elle \u00e9tait il y a 2 si\u00e8cles, pendant la R\u00e9volution Fran\u00e7aise. Au c\u0153ur du jeu vid\u00e9o Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity, la reconstitution 3D de la cath\u00e9drale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u0